  "binding": "OfficialBattlePlayerNativeModelView",
  "operation": "Own a resource-service player lease; expose the original 3100 root and nested Animator. Create a common native body/weapon ordering boundary before appearance initialization, then bind its scene order. Replace the attachment-only shadow placeholder with the exact original shadow subtree and update attachment identities. Run extracted movement cues and original ordinary/on-start death graphs, refresh appearance, revive and dispose. Unity owns Animator and native physics advancement.",
